# Pinterest Pack With Every Recipe

When creating or publishing a Grandma Recipe article, **always ship a Pinterest pack in the same change** so the GitHub Action can pin on push.

## Required with the article

1. `pinterest-pins/<slug>/UPLOAD.txt` + pin image (`.jpg` or `.png` only for API upload)
2. Mirror the same folder under `public/pinterest-pins/<slug>/`
3. Do **not** leave pin creation as a follow-up after publish

## Pin image aspect

- Pin images must be **9:16 portrait** (tall Pinterest format, e.g. 1080×1920)
- Do **not** use 16:9 landscape for Pinterest packs
- Generate or crop a dedicated tall pin (do not ship the wide feature image as-is)

## UPLOAD.txt rules

- Include `BOARD`, `BOARD_ID`, `IMAGE FILE`, `TITLE`, `DESCRIPTION`, `DESTINATION LINK`, `ALT TEXT`
- `DESTINATION LINK` must be `https://www.grandmarecipe.com/<slug>/`
- End `DESCRIPTION` with exactly:
  ```
  Get the full recipe on Grandma Recipe.
  ```
- Do **not** append the recipe URL at the end of the description (the destination link field already carries the URL)
- No pork / no alcohol content or imagery
- Em dashes (`—`) are banned; use commas instead

